"Place the start settlements yourselves instead of the beginner layout.":"Zet de startnederzettingen zelf neer in plaats van de beginnersopstelling.",
"Lead three tribes to success, one after the other. 11 development points win.":"Voer drie stammen na elkaar naar succes. 11 ontwikkelingspunten winnen.",
